NOAA NCEI volcano databases
---------------------------

Datasets: volcanoes (the 49 volcanoes NCEI lists in the Philippines) and
significant_eruptions (the 50 significant eruptions it lists there, from
3580 BC to 2024).

Publisher: NOAA's National Centers for Environmental Information (NCEI),
the Volcano Locations Database (metadata record G02135) and the Global
Significant Volcanic Eruptions Database (record G10147). NCEI says the
volcano list is obtained from the Smithsonian Institution's Global
Volcanism Program, Volcanoes of the World.
https://www.ncei.noaa.gov/products/natural-hazards/tsunamis-earthquakes-volcanoes/volcanoes

Licence: CC0 1.0 Universal (CC0-1.0), the licence data.gov's record of the
Global Volcano Locations Database gives. NCEI's metadata says of the
locations: "Not subject to copyright protection within the United
States", and of the eruptions: "Access to this dataset is unrestricted."
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

Credit, as NCEI's metadata asks the data be cited: National Geophysical
Data Center / World Data Service (NGDC/WDS): NCEI/WDS Global Significant
Volcanic Eruptions Database. NOAA National Centers for Environmental
Information. doi:10.7289/V5JW8BSH, accessed 2026-10-25.

Where and when: read on 2026-10-25 at 13:06:12 UTC from NCEI's natural
hazards service, each in one page:

  https://www.ngdc.noaa.gov/hazel/hazard-service/api/v1/volcanolocs?country=Philippines
  (13,163 bytes, SHA-256 d22e558558f74be330bdf54bdbed9fe2d1abebd9df2eb4a29976430d3379c65e)
  https://www.ngdc.noaa.gov/hazel/hazard-service/api/v1/volcanoes?country=Philippines
  (25,426 bytes, SHA-256 ab097b7281f9f852589333722a7395804b903ab9fa5420e137d44d59290d9828)

Kept: each volcano's id, name, location, kind, elevation, status, the code
of its last known eruption and that code in words, from NCEI's list in
record G02135 ("D1 - Last known eruption 1964 or later" and so on), placed
by its latitude and longitude; each eruption's id, volcano id and name,
date, explosivity index (VEI), deaths and total deaths.


